#: locale.cpp:351
msgid "This is where you live. KDE will use the defaults for this country."
msgstr "hierdie is waar jy lewe. kde sal gebruik die verstek vir hierdie land."

#: locale.cpp:354
msgid ""
"This will add a language to the list. If the language is already in the "
"list, the old one will be moved instead."
msgstr ""
"hierdie sal voeg by 'n taal aan die lys. as die taal is alreeds in die lys, "
"die ou een sal wees verskuif in plaas van."

#: locale.cpp:358
msgid "This will remove the highlighted language from the list."
msgstr "hierdie sal verwyder die verlig taal van die lys."

#: locale.cpp:361
msgid ""
"KDE program will be displayed in the first available language in this list. "
"If none of the languages are available, US English will be used."
msgstr ""
"kde program sal wees vertoon in die eerste beskikbaar taal in hierdie lys. "
"as geen van die tale word beskikbaar, us engels sal wees gebruik word."

#: locale.cpp:368
msgid ""
"Here you can choose your country. The settings for languages, numbers etc. "
"will automatically switch to the corresponding values."
msgstr ""
"hier jy kan kies jou land. die instellings vir tale, nommers etc. sal "
"automaties wissel aan die ooreenstemmend waardes."

#: locale.cpp:375
msgid ""
"Here you can choose the languages that will be used by KDE. If the first "
"language in the list is not available, the second will be used etc. If only "
"US English is available, no translations have been installed. You can get "
"translations packages for many languages from the place you got KDE "
"from."
"<p>Note that some applications may not be translated to your languages; in "
"this case, they will automatically fall back to English US."
msgstr ""
"hier jy kan kies die tale wat sal wees gebruik word deur kde. as die eerste "
"taal in die lys is nie beskikbaar, die tweede sal wees gebruik word etc. as "
"slegs us engels is beskikbaar, nee vertalings het al geïnstalleer. jy kan "
"kry vertalings pakette vir veel tale van die plek jy het gekry kde "
"van."
"<p>nota wat sommige programme dalk mag nie wees vertaalde aan jou tale; in "
"hierdie kas, hulle sal automaties val terug aan engels us."

